  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Groundnut Oil Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to expand UAMPCS operations by acquiring a tractor; purchasing more groundnuts; acquiring a vehicle to transport raw materials and finished groundnut oil; and establish a revolving loan facility.</narrative>
